  {"id":"collaboration:sa-v6-v6-eink-fujifilm-signage","type":"Collaboration","name":"元太與富士影像系統大型彩色看板合作","attributes":{"verification_status":"reported","evidence_ids":["evidence:sa-v6-a23772d9d83d26b6","evidence:sa-v6-ae165a089bd80a5a","evidence:sa-v6-baa0698c886a8731"],"as_of":"2026-11-25","last_verified_at":"2026-11-25","scope":"雙方10/21具名同日原文支持大型彩色看板協業；合作先針對日本鐵道，原型評估成功後才按予定導入。55吋原型2026/12、量產2027/3；B1原型2027/10、量產2028/1皆非實現紀錄。只記announced合作，不建直接買方供貨或富士控股母公司。","stage":"announced","collaboration_type":"strategic_partnership","announced_at":"2026-10-21"}},
